mavlink2_v2.py -> Contains a simple mission that will take off the flight and then land

Needs to have an additional out interface out in the SITL

```
./Tools/autotest/sim_vehicle.py -v ArduCopter -D  -l 51.8752066,14.6487840,54.15,0 --out=127.0.0.1:1337 -M --gdb 

```
The out thing needs to be there.

### Dockerfile
You can now use the dockerfile to rebuild stuff, just need to have a version of ardupilot_pgfuzz codebase in the same directory

Just need to ensure (no-mavproxy)
```
./Tools/autotest/sim_vehicle.py -v ArduCopter --no-mavproxy

```
